WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.273
Jordan and Scarlet were screaming at the top of their lungs.

2
00:00:06.274 --> 00:00:11.411
"TV! TV! We want to watch TV!"

3
00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:18.844
Vinnie and Mandy’s parents had gone shopping with Uncle Wilson and Aunt Leah.

4
00:00:18.845 --> 00:00:22.815
Before leaving, Aunt Leah had said:

5
00:00:22.816 --> 00:00:26.707
"No TV for Jordan and Scarlet."

6
00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:30.471
"You’re not allowed," began Vinnie.

7
00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:34.336
The twins started screaming again.

8
00:00:34.337 --> 00:00:37.679
"How about some ice cream!"

9
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.080
Mandy said, clapping her hands.

10
00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:44.362
"Ice cream?" cried Scarlet.

11
00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:47.708
"We have chocolate and strawberry,"

12
00:00:47.709 --> 00:00:51.542
said Mandy, walking toward the kitchen.

13
00:00:51.543 --> 00:00:54.537
The twins followed quietly.

14
00:00:54.538 --> 00:00:57.474
Vinnie wiped his forehead.

15
00:00:57.475 --> 00:00:59.477
"Babysitting is hard.

16
00:00:59.478 --> 00:01:02.872
I need a break," he said to himself.

17
00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:08.145
Vinnie started for his bedroom, and then changed his mind.

18
00:01:08.146 --> 00:01:10.744
He walked up to the attic.

19
00:01:10.745 --> 00:01:15.147
"I wonder if I should . . . " thought Vinnie.

20
00:01:15.148 --> 00:01:16.833
"No, I can’t.

21
00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:18.157
Mandy will be mad.

22
00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:21.358
But she’s downstairs having ice cream . . . "

23
00:01:21.359 --> 00:01:24.218
Vinnie found the album.

24
00:01:24.219 --> 00:01:29.215
"I’m only going to take a peek," he said to himself.

25
00:01:29.216 --> 00:01:32.829
"I’ll close it if I see a glowing picture."

26
00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:36.290
He sat down and opened the album.

27
00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:40.707
At the same time, Mandy burst into the attic.

28
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:43.804
"I knew it!" she shouted.

29
00:01:43.805 --> 00:01:47.350
"I knew you would try to go without me!"

30
00:01:47.351 --> 00:01:52.342
"But I . . . well . . . I . . . ," Vinnie stammered.

31
00:01:52.343 --> 00:01:56.004
Mandy snatched the album from his hands.

32
00:01:56.005 --> 00:01:58.407
A photo was glowing.

33
00:01:58.408 --> 00:02:04.604
"Oh, how strange!" she gasped.

34
00:02:04.605 --> 00:02:08.468
Vinnie got up and looked over her shoulder.

35
00:02:08.469 --> 00:02:14.469
The old man stood between two statues of scary-looking animals.

36
00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:20.779
They had big eyes and huge mouths with many sharp teeth.

37
00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.687
Behind the statues was a tall structure.

38
00:02:24.688 --> 00:02:30.093
It was glowing brightly.

39
00:02:30.094 --> 00:02:35.883
"It looks like rooftops stacked on top of each other," remarked Vinnie.

40
00:02:35.884 --> 00:02:40.587
"I wonder where this could be?" said Mandy.

41
00:02:40.588 --> 00:02:44.472
"I don’t know, but . . . ," Vinnie paused.

42
00:02:44.473 --> 00:02:46.647
"Where are the twins?"

43
00:02:46.648 --> 00:02:53.404
Just as Vinnie asked that question, Jordan and Scarlet appeared at the door.

44
00:02:53.405 --> 00:03:01.362
And at that exact moment, Vinnie and Mandy fell down the dark tunnel.

45
00:03:01.363 --> 00:03:04.352
"Hey!" cried Mandy.

46
00:03:04.353 --> 00:03:07.600
"Whoa!" cried Vinnie.

47
00:03:07.601 --> 00:03:16.005
"Hooray!" shouted people as they clapped loudly.

48
00:03:16.006 --> 00:03:19.868
"Huh?" Vinnie opened his eyes.

49
00:03:19.869 --> 00:03:24.069
He was lying on a stage in front of lots of people.

50
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.406
Mandy was next to him.

51
00:03:26.407 --> 00:03:31.079
"What’s going on?" she whispered to her brother.

52
00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.584
"Wasn’t that amazing?"

53
00:03:33.585 --> 00:03:36.608
A man stood in front of them.

54
00:03:36.609 --> 00:03:39.341
He was waving to the crowd.

55
00:03:39.342 --> 00:03:42.087
"Come back for our next show!"

56
00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:44.909
The crowd moved away.

57
00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:49.141
Then the man turned and looked down at them.

58
00:03:49.142 --> 00:03:52.417
"Who are you?" he said, stunned.

59
00:03:52.418 --> 00:03:54.541
"How did you do that?"

60
00:03:54.542 --> 00:03:57.816
"Do what?" asked Vinnie.

61
00:03:57.817 --> 00:04:02.933
"It looked as if you fell from the sky," he said, pointing up.

62
00:04:02.934 --> 00:04:06.348
"I am Samir the great magician.

63
00:04:06.349 --> 00:04:09.670
And yet, I cannot explain how you did that."

64
00:04:09.671 --> 00:04:13.533
The children got up and looked around.

65
00:04:13.534 --> 00:04:17.539
"Where are we?" asked Mandy.

66
00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:21.600
They were in a large square.

67
00:04:21.601 --> 00:04:27.014
Mandy could hear music and the sounds of animals.

68
00:04:27.015 --> 00:04:30.867
Samir laughed.

69
00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:36.603
"You are at a celebration for Master Yuan—an important government official."

70
00:04:36.604 --> 00:04:40.359
"Which government?" asked Vinnie.

71
00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:43.582
Samir looked at him in surprise.

72
00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:52.186
"Why, the Tang Dynasty of China, of course," he replied.

